WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.137
The four-day week can benefit 
workers, companies and society. 

00:00:05.137 --> 00:00:09.056
The research shows that 
people are less stressed,

00:00:09.056 --> 00:00:13.400
value their jobs more and have&nbsp;
better lives outside of work.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.210
In most cases, they 
are as productive

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:18.874
in four days as 
they are&nbsp;in five.

00:00:18.874 --> 00:00:22.474
The secret sauce is 
work reorganization,

00:00:22.474 --> 00:00:25.410
cutting out the least 
productive activities.

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:27.873
Meetings are a 
prime target.

00:00:27.873 --> 00:00:30.062
Companies can also 
see benefits

00:00:30.062 --> 00:00:31.688
through lower turnover

00:00:31.688 --> 00:00:34.489
and a higher-quality 
applicant pool.

00:00:34.489 --> 00:00:37.427
The four-day week is 
a down payment

00:00:37.427 --> 00:00:39.564
on a new way&nbsp;
to live and work.

00:00:40.062 --> 00:00:42.677
And yes, we're going to 
need government help

00:00:42.677 --> 00:00:45.198
if we're going to move beyond 
the&nbsp;innovative companies

00:00:45.198 --> 00:00:47.167
that already see its virtues.

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:51.620
But as the three-day weekend 
spreads, we can&nbsp;realize

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:54.754
everyone deserves a 
right to free time.

